# Letters measure by their record's width byte.
name: 0191-letter-advance-measure
kind: module
module: 0
region: code
address: 0x306282e
gate: build refuses unless the stock bytes at the target equal
  `expect`. Pairs with 0190.
expect: 6846
replace: 02e0
rationale: The string measurer's per-character width (0x030627BE)
  repeats the drawer's rule. This replaces `mov r0, sp` with a branch
  over the ink measure and its `uxth r4, r0`, so measured widths
  (centering, wrapping, marquee thresholds) match what 0190 draws.
  0x03063E06 has no other callers.
